WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The word says one thing. The ink asks another.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
A practiced reading habit competes with naming the color.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
In selected experiments, suggestion changed Stroop task performance.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Some research found suggestion effects without hypnosis induction.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
A controlled task does not prove a commercial audio product works.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Follow the sources. Try a free twelve-minute practice.
